"modification": "Introduction of an Isopropyl Group at the Phenolic Hydroxyl",
"rationale": "Building on the previous two suggestions, this modification introduces a bulkier isopropyl group. This could provide a more significant hydrophobic interaction with the HDAC1 binding pocket. The isopropyl group is also conformationally restricted, which could improve binding selectivity.  The synthesis would involve reaction with isopropyl iodide under basic conditions.  The increased bulk could also introduce steric clashes, so this is a risk, but the potential for a significant improvement in potency warrants investigation.",
