"rationale": "This modification introduces an acetyl group, which is a slightly larger and more lipophilic group than a methyl group. The carbonyl group of the acetyl moiety can act as a hydrogen bond acceptor, potentially forming a favorable interaction with the HDAC1 active site. The increased lipophilicity could also improve binding affinity by promoting hydrophobic interactions. The synthesis would involve reaction with acetyl chloride or acetic anhydride under basic conditions.",
